  "notes": "12-week fat-loss block, 5 days (Mon-Fri), 3 upper + 2 lower sessions, no barbell squats. Every weight starts at 0: the app suggests one from anything you have logged for that exercise, otherwise pick a weight you could do for 3 more reps than the target on the first session. Compounds add the increment each time you hit every set. Isolation lifts run a rep range: reps climb one at a time to the top, then the weight goes up and reps drop back. Miss twice at the same weight and the app drops it 10%. Finish every session with the 25-minute incline walk at 120-135 bpm. Weeks 4, 8 and 12 are deloads: weights -10% and one set fewer per exercise, automatically. Target 8,000-10,000 steps a day, 190-200 g protein, and a weekly-average weight loss of 1-2 lb.",
